1
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:51,000
Sleepover Massacre (Prologue) is a drama film directed by Gary Whitson.

2
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:36,000
After the original movie had been shot and edited, we decided to shoot additional footage that delves into the
nightmares that Denise (Clancey McCauley) was experiencing prior to the events that occur in the movie.

3
00:08:15,000 --> 00:08:21,000
The original plan was to re-edit the movie and add this footage.

4
00:11:00,000 --> 00:11:06,000
But we have now placed it on a bonus disk so you can see for
yourself what led up to the ending of Sleepover Massacre.

5
00:13:45,000 --> 00:13:51,000
Magnum, P.I.

6
00:16:30,000 --> 00:16:36,000
is an American crime drama television series starring Tom Selleck
as Thomas Magnum, a private investigator in Hawaii.

7
00:19:15,000 --> 00:19:21,000
The series ran on CBS, which broadcast 162 first-run episodes over
eight seasons, from December 11, 1980, to May 1, 1988.
